    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96388" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγ-αστρον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>covering, cover,
			wrapper</i>, esp. of leather (<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.180
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				992(984)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				367
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				109.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii/iv A.D.)</span>; =
			<i>segestrum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>; cf. Varro <i><span class="en">
				<u>LL</u>
				5.166
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>place in which to hide</i> or <i>keep</i> anything,
				<i>receptacle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				52.9
			</span></i>.</div>
